{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/415d95111c83e8e12d72987cf71eb8ee.avif?t=1754614312\" width=456 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After taking a wrong turn, a human woman stumbles across a castle in the woods. It's now home to the alien species of Konekomi \u2014 iridescent cat-humanoids. They're passive but deadly, and hard to please. Every choice can change a Konekomi's opinion... and your chances of finding home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/acc09022d13d575e6dd2f9af384be391.avif?t=1754614312\" width=495 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Konekomi Castle is a puzzle/adventure game with multiple endings. You can interact with the Konekomi and gain items and character states that change your path. For each ending you achieve, you can obtain a key item which you keep for your next playthrough. Achieving every ending of the game should last a few hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/27bb8a7c60f69f52def5a54ba7f40f49.avif?t=1754614312\" width=306 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/9dc57eaa772f4d6b6a2277b840a256d8.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sakira</strong>, the innocent protagonist, may be the only sane mind in this castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/9c8cea995fcc2599ba32084d437c38cb.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jira</strong>, the supreme overseer, is someone you know is dangerous before you even meet them.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/c38f9694e17ce7aae18fc25a51fc7eb4.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mana</strong>, the two-faced tactician, seems to have a lot of authority in the castle, and knows a lot more than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/752a5a99349bfe22f5209d70dd0f8d35.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momo</strong>, the waist-high huggable, loves to provide affection to anyone who needs it, regardless of their opinion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/d5831714368687c2303e1987356baad8.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Big Sleepy</strong>, the room-sized Konekomi, is too tired to provide a description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/4ebd353542f0ae8114a26c8450be6174.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vini</strong>, the unsociable artist, is responsible for almost every painting in the castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/b93955761487655f6831b4fcccc85bca.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devi</strong>, the playful rogue, carves their own way, right through your stomach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/2f57222290d8ffe1cc2f9464e32c052f.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reta</strong>, the staircase operator, has only one job, and that's to operate the staircase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/be601395b5dc95ad0b2ab8fd62c2e0f6.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Announcer</strong>, or Niko, commentates Katjo, the wildly popular sport in Konekomi Castle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812300?t=1754614312","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812300?t=1754614312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/50500a7bbf3d8ca0cad2de8a39dd85b5d738e1f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754614312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/50500a7bbf3d8ca0cad2de8a39dd85b5d738e1f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754614312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/415d95111c83e8e1