_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/2f57222290d8ffe1cc2f9464e32c052f.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reta</strong>, the staircase operator, has only one job, and that's to operate the staircase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/extras/be601395b5dc95ad0b2ab8fd62c2e0f6.avif?t=1754614312\" width=96 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Announcer</strong>, or Niko, commentates Katjo, the wildly popular sport in Konekomi Castle.</p>","developers":["Waiting For Neko"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/3c7eed0c31ee3692c6a080b3b16d0c8aab97ea7c/header.jpg?t=1754614312","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distro released after 2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 or ARM64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13, 14, or 15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 or ARM64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812300/1355963666/cc3e9dbecb4de011a7980ad3cbb25ee6619dd124/1754312165/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754313416","dash_h264":